      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13fbaddf144da8e16af0c74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是北寄贝饭啰！\\n我可是已经都备好料了吶♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "79dee1cbf0c0704fa175aea2fce0c59e375cc48b0d7bc78d860231bef3057b42",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "966"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab4695e46ad67efff94c773",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家为我加油～♪\\n今后也要继续支持我跟苫小牧喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb312d9908827ba6e3c1bc095f722ba678fc3ebb01b6fd81ad00d2552469fe0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "967"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c8f59ea4d0dbeff7645fc6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超级开心～！\\n毕竟决赛不可能轻松，我会打起精神的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d396497d831623c19d8d01a14cc04f844b7ee67249869b6573ce6ddbe4499a86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "968"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb573c51fc24c3003c37118e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想想喔～应该还是……\\n随时尽全力认真又脚踏实地吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb1d40856f65352d801d905b7173dc11614b00e8186fb2126e0048923903cf1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "969"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30049f764439b51b697c333e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谈论已经结束的比赛也没意义吧。\\n……硬要说的话，我玩得很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "348d20e7897c15ee4b72ae0c67697fa57d73f5d717c5d2546ffda9bbf778f7f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a3904cb3efa28cbddada24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦？啊……我会努力呗～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "207ed310ffd0f6f0d6cc78c5d86b46f567fd20a60b5487ccc108405ec1fe8ac4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "970"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c6f7185be9e44d30a38dbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超级开心～！\\n毕竟决赛不可能轻松，我会打起精神的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d396497d831623c19d8d01a14cc04f844b7ee67249869b6573ce6ddbe4499a86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
