        "232",
        "978"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c116f5b2bfcba4d392f1ab52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不，我目前还不会这么做。\\n直到我抓住至高胜利的那一刻为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b951514a0d278e0e02a8eb09307bcb8b19dda881449c5db895521807483a3b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "979"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55402a14b111673978ba19ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我怎么知道。\\n……要等时候到了才会晓得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "391adcc8575f17a576079986781f8c2589105c08cc39e08136d4bd31a28e2cd4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6321ace056e7d64313d1a8f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……非要举个例子出来的话，\\n我想是一边回顾竞赛一边享用的红茶吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57089c2bdbc42b4ebbcaea2a95567c4818a1928acc0ce060cb0984b96673cf4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "980"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:642377aa52bda6a3644b7880",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完成缓和运动后，做好接受采访的准备。\\n根据当天行程，有的时候也会谒见来宾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09029ad2d20c506513955e7ec6890954ae6fa534c90a1b149796cbe2a6956982",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "981"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d9e9056086a118fb9854755",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今后也请各位持续给予我声援。\\n而我也将以至高的成果作为回报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4efff4754f68d0b0b229264c940e88bec14c76235519268790361d637125b6d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
